Root cause:
The bug was caused by the SP804 timer clocks not being correctly configured to use the appropriate clock sources from the SP810 system controller, leading to incorrect clock frequencies being used for the timers. The default clock configuration did not account for the new clock sources introduced by the SP810, which resulted in the timers potentially operating at incorrect frequencies.

